{title: FAMINDRA TANORA}
{artist: MBOLA TALENTA}
{key: SOL}
{singers: *=5 voix}
{musicians: Haja=guitare, Toky=basse}

Ny famindran-tanora miraika:
Toy izao, toy izao
Tsy miraidraika tsy maka mahery
Midoladola
Miraidraika sy mitopatopa
Misosa mora
Fa toy ny zozoro tanora
tsofindrivotra
Indray midola.

